                  <handDesc>
                     <summary>Italian semi-cursive script</summary>
                     <handNote><locus>Ff. 1r-42r (until just before the end of the fifth
                           line)</locus> were copied by an anonymous scribe. The remainder of the
                        manuscript (<locus>ff. 42r (from the end of the fifth line)-92v</locus>) was
                        copied by <persName>Binyamin ben Avraham ha-Rofe <foreign xml:lang="he"
                              >בנימין בן אברהם הרופא</foreign></persName>, whose colophon is found
                        on <locus>f. 77v</locus>.</handNote>
                  </handDesc>
                  <bindingDesc>
                     <p>Marbled paper over paper boards, quarter-bound in smooth golden leather. The
                        current shelfmark has been gold-tooled on the spine.</p>
                  </bindingDesc>
